---
import SiteLayout from '@nyameko/ui/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Events" siteName="Quantum Platform" section="User Portal"
  description="Verified Quantum Platform workshops, research demonstrations and community events.">
  <section class="section container events-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH COMMUNITY</p>
    <h1>Events</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Hands-on workshops, research demonstrations, training programmes
      and events that bring the quantum and HPC community together.
    </p>
    <section class="events-section" aria-labelledby="upcoming-title">
      <h2 id="upcoming-title">Upcoming events</h2>
      <p>No upcoming Quantum Platform events have been published yet.</p>
      <p class="muted">Confirmed sessions will include prerequisites, registration details, a time zone and contact information.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="events-section" aria-labelledby="past-title">
      <h2 id="past-title">Past events and materials</h2>
      <p>Verified event materials, recordings and reproducible demonstrations will appear here after editorial review.</p>
      <p>Explore the <a href="https://github.com/nyameko/quantum-workflows">scientific workflows repository</a> for existing work in progress.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .events-page { max-width: 65rem; padding-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; margin: .4rem 0; }
  .events-section { margin-top: 1.6rem; padding: 1.3rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .9rem; background: var(--surface); }
  .events-section h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
</style>
